    "ground_truth_use": "GT creates the synthetic odometry input and independently scores final trajectories and accepted loop measurements; it is never passed to the loop detector as an oracle.",
    "frontend_exclusion": "This isolates backend loop correction and does not model FAST_LIO scan matching, timing, deskew, or sensor failure.",
    "threshold_preregistration": "Thresholds were frozen after one non-formal seed-17 drive0005 diagnostic and before any formal FA-02B run. The diagnostic exposed one catastrophic loop, so the zero-catastrophic threshold intentionally does not make the starting implementation green.",
